Here’s how you can trigger the notification using the provided function:

```javascript
// Notify the routing‑nodes observer that shardA (unassigned) has moved to shardB (initializing)
functions.RoutingNodesChangedObserver_shardInitialized({
  unassignedShard: "shardA",
  initializedShard: "shardB"
});
```

This call will inform the observer that the shard previously in the *unassigned* state (`shardA`) is now transitioning to the *initializing* state (`shardB`).
